<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's est receipts 110,000, Wk ago 100,000, and Yr ago 101,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower than mid-session Wednesday. Trade was moderate for light to moderate demand and moderate offerings. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 53.50 -54.50	   54.50 -55.50</p>
<p>few			   53.00  55.00	   54.00  56.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>260-280 lbs		 51.50 -54.50	   52.00 -55.50</p>
<p>US 2-4   43-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>280-300 lbs		 48.00 -53.00	   48.50 -54.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $55.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.     42.00 -44.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		46.00 -50.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		 50.00 -54.50	   50.00 -55.50</p>
